<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικάρπ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκαρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			) <i>bringer</i> or <i>guardian of fruits</i>, epith. of
			Zeus, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				401a19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1048c
			</span></i>, etc.; of Hermes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).252
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					30.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>fruit-bearing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					552
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ</span>. <i>pedicle</i> or
				<i>fruit-stalk</i>, Phaniasap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.68c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				51c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>on</i> or <i>for the wrist</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὄφεις</span>
			<i>bracelets</i> in the shape of snakes, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικάρπιον, τό</span>, <i>part</i>
			<i>of the hand near the wrist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.84
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
